invalid type: string "API: manim.utils.tex_templates.TexTemplateLibrary\nName: TexTemplateLibrary\nKind: class\nModule: manim.utils.tex_templates\nDescription: A collection of basic TeX template objects\n\nExamples\n--------\nNormal usage as a value for the keyword argument tex_template of Tex() and MathTex() mobjects::\n\n    ``Tex(\"My TeX code\", tex_template=TexTemplateLibrary.ctex)``\nted f64